OL,3,AJorja Smith 'very grateful' as she bags
OL,4,Aindependent music prize
OL,5,
OL,6,FJorja Smith was among the artists
OL,7,Frecognised at this year's Independent
OL,8,FMusic Awards for her song The Way I
OL,9,FLove You.
OL,11,FAccepting the award on Tuesday night at
OL,12,FLondon's Roundhouse, Smith reflected on
OL,13,Fher "crazy" music journey and took a
OL,14,Fmoment to mark the achievements of
OL,15,Fother artists.
OL,17,F"Everyone should be so proud," the
OL,18,FWalsall singer said, especially those
OL,19,F"doing everything independently".
OL,21,FThe annual awards celebrate unsigned
OL,22,Fartists and small record labels.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
